  "title": "How often are destruction holds released without a completion certificate?",
  "excerpt": "A review method for destruction batches that records whether a certificate was received before the hold was released and the matter marked destroyed.",
  "published": "2026-11-16",
  "sourceDate": "2026-11-16",
